其人長者。景帝時尊重，常爲九卿。至武帝元朔四年，韓安國免，詔拜歐爲御史大夫。自歐爲吏，未嘗言案人，專以誠長者處官。官屬以爲長者，亦不敢大欺。上具獄事，有可卻，卻之；不可者，不得已，爲涕泣面對而封之。其愛人如此。"}],"rationale":"依本篇姓名、稱號、名歐及名仁等明示與敘事承接判讀；來源原字保留，未自動跨篇同名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p024","text":"御史大夫張叔者，名歐，安丘侯説之庶子也。孝文時以治刑名言事太子。然歐雖治刑名家，其人長者。景帝時尊重，常爲九卿。至武帝元朔四年，韓安國免，詔拜歐爲御史大夫。自歐爲吏，未嘗言案人，專以誠長者處官。官屬以爲長者，亦不敢大欺。上具獄事，有可卻，卻之；不可者，不得已，爲涕泣面對而封之。其愛人如此。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"張叔","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"安丘侯説","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cxg_02f_byh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"dip_c4z_kc6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-103","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi","source":{"title":"史記／卷103","provider":"維基文庫","url":"